    "quorumNeedsEveryLot": {
      "lotsAtMost": 2,
      "refusal": "In a 2-lot scheme the meeting has a quorum only with both lots present or represented, and there is no fallback (Strata Titles Act 1985 (WA) s 130(2), (4)). Both lots must have a vote or an abstention counted at this item, and a lot whose vote is not counted for money owed does not make up the quorum, so the votes cannot be counted",
