      "restrictOrDirectCouncil": "ORDINARY",
      "surveyStrataInsuranceNotForReinstatement": "WITHOUT_DISSENT",
      "unbudgetedSpendingCap": "SPECIAL",
    },
    "source": "Strata Titles Act 1985 (WA) ss 38(1)(b), 44(2), 48, 80, 97(6), 102, 118, 120 to 123, 133, 134, 135(1), Sch 1 by-law 4(8); Strata Titles (General) Regulations 2019 (WA) reg 80",
